00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Michael Hutchence was flying high as the lead singer of the
legendary rock band INXS until his untimely death in 1997.

3
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Richard Lowenstein’s documentary examines Hutchence’s deeply
felt life through his many loves and demons.

